announcement-meteor-shower-title = Meteor shower
announcement-meteor-shower-body = Meteors are on course for { $area }. Clear the area and brace for hull damage.
storyteller-odessa-name = Odessa Tempo
storyteller-odessa-description = Keeps a metronome on her desk and never skips a beat. She lets a crew settle in, then tightens one screw at a time until the whole station hums, and she likes to ease off just before the end so people remember the shift rather than the pain.
storyteller-benny-name = Benny Lull
storyteller-benny-description = Took the night shift so nobody would hurry him. Asks how you are before he breaks anything, prefers trouble that can be fixed before lunch, and would rather hear the crew talk than scream.
storyteller-test-name = Dr. Haste
storyteller-test-description = No patience, no bedside manner, no pause between one thing and the next. Lives on the test bench and never sees a crew.
role-crew = Crew
item-desc-medical-bandage = A roll of gauze for cuts, bruises and holes. Four uses.
item-desc-medical-salve = Ointment for burns. Four uses.
item-desc-medical-oxygen = A canister with a mask, for someone who stopped breathing. Three uses.
item-desc-medical-antidote = A pen of broad antidote, for poison. Three uses.
medicine-care-dead = They are beyond care.
medicine-care-nothing = Nothing on them this treats.
medicine-care-busy = Your hands are busy.
